00:06:52.244 --> 00:06:53.660
In other words,
if I'm a developer

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:59.180
and an external modeler, one of
the user types he talked about,

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.620
you would see a web interface.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.530
You would do various
things in it.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.363
And at the back, you'd
