and, of course,

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.640
data stored in Cloud Storage.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.990
So the first step--

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.800
again, we're doing
this systematically,

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.910
so you'd say create these
resources at this point.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:17.720
And we haven't yet set them
up to be locked down securely.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.220
What first step do we take?

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.670
And what did Two Sigma
do to lock them down?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.730
The very first step is
obviously to use IAM.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:29.580
So all security really--

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.760
and I think it's a
fair thing to say--

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.250
