00:08:13.472 --> 00:08:14.930
but they could do
it from anywhere.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.790
And just hold that
thought in your mind.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:19.340
So at this point, we have
locked down these resources

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:22.100
